variable C11 equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C11 equal 0.5*(175723.368001843+${C1pos})
variable C11 equal 0.5*(175723.368001843+-175203.53509217)
variable C2${dir} equal 0.5*(${C2neg}+${C2pos})
